  diseaseId: covid19
  diseaseName: COVID-19
  generalInfo: "COVID-19, viral bir \xFCst solunum yolu enfeksiyonudur. Hastalarda
    ate\u015F, halsizlik, \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk ve koku azalmas\u0131 gibi belirtiler
    g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Akut ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 mevcut olmas\u0131, hafif ate\u015F,
    kuru \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk var olmas\u0131, koku azalmas\u0131 ve halsizlik ve k\u0131rg\u0131nl\u0131k
    var olmas\u0131 COVID-19\u2019da s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Burun
    t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ve \u015Feffaf burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131
    da g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  diagnosisTips: "\u015Eikayetler 3 g\xFCnd\xFCr var olmas\u0131, temas \xF6yk\xFCs\xFC
    mevcut olmas\u0131 ve \xFCst solunum belirtisi mevcut olmas\u0131 enfeksiyon
    lehine \xF6nemli bulgulard\u0131r. COVID-19 testi pozitif olmas\u0131 tan\u0131y\u0131
    g\xFC\xE7l\xFC \u015Fekilde destekler."
